# 🎯 Recruiter Screening Prompts

A reusable AI prompt template I built to screen tech candidates consistently, from resume review through the post-interview write-up.

## How it works
1. **Non-negotiable checker.** Flags the 3 must-have skills as ✅ Confirmed / ⚠️ Partial / ❌ Not Found
2. **Resume vs JD score.** A weighted score out of 100, broken down by skill area
3. **Interview questions.** 2–4 candidate-specific questions for the HR screening round
4. **Post-interview evaluation.** Hiring manager feedback, an ATS note and a final requirement-match verdict

## How to use
1. Open [screening-prompt-template.md](screening-prompt-template.md) and copy it.
2. Fill in the role's job description, must-haves and scoring areas.
3. Paste the candidate's resume at the end and run it in Claude or another AI assistant.
4. After the interview, share the transcript in the same chat to get the final evaluation.

